/-!
# A110023

A triangle of coefficients based on A000931 and Pascal's triangle: a(n)=a(n-2)+a(n-3); t(n,m)=a(n - m + 1)*a(m + 1)*Binomial[n, m].

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A110023

